    title: "Enumerate std::io and std::io::BufReader: a TRAIT surface, not a function list — decide what a wrapper inherits from the reader it wraps"  # d4ab
    status: todo_hard  # d4ab
    priority: 2  # d4ab
    parent:  # d4ab
